# Build context for the bisrDE image: send only what the Dockerfile copies.
# Everything else in differential_expression/ (renv/, renv.lock, results,
# brs*_results, *.sif, tui/ and its bisrde-tui binary, tests/, nf-module/,
# .nf-test, docs/, assets/ screenshots and example data, logs, the launcher
# scripts) stays on the host.
*

!environment.yml
!de.R
!warm_msigdb_cache.R
!bisrDE

# Editor and session leftovers inside the package source.
bisrDE/.RData
bisrDE/.Rhistory
bisrDE/.Rproj.user
**/.DS_Store
